# Build-time configuration.
#
# Copy this to `src-tauri/.env`, not to the repository root. `dotenvy` searches
# upward and would find either, but `build.rs` declares
# `cargo:rerun-if-changed=.env` relative to the crate — so a root-level copy is
# read once and then never watched, and editing it does not rebuild anything.
#
# Nothing here is required to build: the app compiles and runs without a .env
# at all.

# ── No Google credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SYNABIT_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, SYNABIT_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET and
# SYNABIT_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID used to be required here, and the build failed
# without them. Google Drive has been removed from every platform, so they are
# gone: there is no OAuth client to register, no consent screen to verify, and
# no client secret to keep out of the repository.
